    program change events in parts                             controller events
21  Sysex and meta events (list editor)    Missing  edit       liste/ insert code
23  Convert midi <-> drum track            Missing  edit       track list "Convert ..." actions
    SYNTHS
36  Synth parameters                       Missing  control    synth's SynthIF controls (set_plugin_param
                                                               only reaches effect slots)
37  Midi port / soft synth setup           Missing  edit       Midi Ports/Soft Synths dialog code
    TEMPO / SIGNATURE / KEY
38  Delete or move tempo / signature       Missing  edit       UndoOp DeleteTempo, DeleteSig
    changes (only adding is possible)
39  Key signatures                         Missing  read/edit  UndoOp AddKey, DeleteKey, ModifyKey
    WAVE EDITING
40  Normalize, fade in/out, reverse,       Missing  edit       waveedit/wavecanvas.cpp
    mute selection, wave offset                                (normalizeSelection() etc.)
41  Render downmix to a wave track         Missing  dangerous  "Render Downmix to Selected Wave Track"
    FILES
42  Import audio file                      Missing  dangerous  MusE import audio action
43  Import midi file / part                Missing  dangerous  MusE::importMidi(), importPart()
44  Export midi file                       Missing  dangerous  MusE::exportMidi()
45  New / open song, save as, templates    Missing  dangerous  (would replace the song the client
                                                               works on; probably leave out)
46  Project description                    Missing  edit       Edit Project Description dialog
    TRANSPORT
47  Punch in / out                         Missing  control    transport punch actions
48  Panic (all notes off)                  Missing  control    MusE panic action
49  Metronome settings (beyond on/off)     Missing  control    metronome settings
50  Rewind on stop                         Missing  control    (a setting)

Left out on purpose: view and application things (follow mode, fullscreen, docks, colors of the
GUI, opening editor windows, plugin and synth GUIs, global settings, shortcuts, midi sync setup,
appearance, help).

Suggested order (my view, by what an assistant working in a song needs most):
  1. Automation points (1, 2, 4)
  2. Midi functions and controllers (16-21)
  3. File import/export (42-44)
  4. Tempo, signature and key map (38-39)


